<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>{{ title }} — Reny Paes</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ resumo }}"/>
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{ title }} — Reny Paes"/>
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{ resumo }}"/>
  {% if capa %}<meta property="og:image" content="{{ capa }}"/>{% endif %}
  <meta property="og:type" content="article"/>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://renypaes.netlify.app/posts/{{ page.fileSlug }}/"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;0,900;1,700&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #0C0618; --deep: #130A24; --plum: #3D1060;
      --violet: #7C3AED; --lavender: #A78BFA; --muted: #9B8BAE;
      --white: #FAF8FF; --green: #22C55E;
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); overflow-x: hidden; line-height: 1.8; }

    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 200;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.1rem 6vw;
      background: rgba(12,6,24,0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(124,58,237,0.12);
    }
    .logo { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; }
    .logo span { color: var(--lavender); font-style: italic; }
    .nav-back { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; transition: color .2s; }
    .nav-back:hover { color: var(--lavender); }

    .post-hero {
      padding: 8rem 6vw 4rem;
      max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .post-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .post-cat {
      background: rgba(124,58,237,.2); border: 1px solid rgba(124,58,237,.35);
      color: var(--lavender); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase; padding: .3rem .9rem; border-radius: 100px;
    }
    .post-date { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .post-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .post-resumo { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .post-capa {
      width: 100%; max-height: 480px; object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 3rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(124,58,237,.2);
    }

    .post-body {
      max-width: 740px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 6vw 6rem;
    }
    .post-body h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.7rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; color: var(--white); }
    .post-body h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 2rem 0 .8rem; color: var(--lavender); }
    .post-body p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1.4rem; font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight: 300; }
    .post-body strong { color: var(--white); font-weight: 500; }
    .post-body a { color: var(--lavender); text-decoration: underline; }
    .post-body ul, .post-body ol { color: var(--muted); padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
    .post-body li { margin-bottom: .5rem; font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight: 300; }
    .post-body blockquote {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--violet); padding-left: 1.5rem;
      margin: 2rem 0; font-style: italic; color: var(--lavender); font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .post-body hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(124,58,237,.2); margin: 2.5rem 0; }

    .post-cta {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(61,16,96,.4), rgba(124,58,237,.15));
      border: 1px solid rgba(124,58,237,.25); border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 2.5rem; text-align: center; margin: 3rem 0;
    }
    .post-cta p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: .95rem; }
    .btn-wa {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem;
      background: #25D366; color: #fff; font-weight: 600;
      padding: .9rem 2rem; border-radius: 100px; text-decoration: none;
      transition: all .25s;
    }
    .btn-wa:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(37,211,102,.4); }

    .wa-float {
      position: fixed; bottom: 2rem; right: 2rem; z-index: 300;
      width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #25D366; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(37,211,102,.4); text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform .25s;
    }
    .wa-float:hover { transform: scale(1.12); }

    footer {
      padding: 2rem 6vw; border-top: 1px solid rgba(124,58,237,.1);
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem;
    }
    footer p { font-size: .82rem; color: rgba(155,139,174,.5); }
    footer a { color: var(--lavender); text-decoration: none; font-size: .82rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="/" class="logo">Reny Paes <span>// Estratégia</span></a>
  <a href="/blog.html" class="nav-back">← Voltar ao Blog</a>
</nav>

<div class="post-hero">
  <div class="post-meta">
    {% if categoria %}<span class="post-cat">{{ categoria }}</span>{% endif %}
    {% if date %}<span class="post-date">{{ date | dataFormatada }}</span>{% endif %}
  </div>
  <h1 class="post-title">{{ title }}</h1>
  {% if resumo %}<p class="post-resumo">{{ resumo }}</p>{% endif %}
  {% if capa %}<img src="{{ capa }}" alt="{{ title }}" class="post-capa"/>{% endif %}
</div>

<div class="post-body">
  {{ content | safe }}

  <div class="post-cta">
    <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:.8rem;">Quer aplicar essa estratégia no seu negócio?</h3>
    <p>Fale comigo e vamos construir juntos uma presença digital que gera resultados reais.</p>
